and not offered to the general public as a standalone product.

"Your Affiliates" means entities that control, are controlled by, or are under
common control with You, where "control" means ownership of more than fifty
percent (50%) of voting interests.

"Your Personnel" means Your employees, contractors, and agents acting on Your
behalf, and personnel of Your Affiliates, in each case solely in connection
with Internal Use.

"Subscription Service" means making the Software, or a product or service whose
primary value to users is the functionality of the Software (or substantially
similar functionality), available to third parties over a network, where:

  (a) access is provided on a multi-tenant or shared hosted basis; or

  (b) access is conditioned on payment, a recurring fee, or registration as a
      customer of a commercial offering whose main purpose is to provide that
